  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>營火重生與調整（Campfire Spawn and Tweaks）為遊戲增添了在營火內設定重生點的功能，並對營火區塊的機制進行了一些調整。預設情況下，你重生時會獲得 10 秒的火焰抗性，並且會直接出現在營火頂端。該功能適用於主世界、地獄和終界，也適用於模組新增的維度。<br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"><br><br><span><strong>預設設定下的功能：</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>營火放置時預設為熄滅狀態。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>點燃營火會在其頂端創建一個重生點。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>使用沙、泥土或靈魂砂對著營火右鍵，可以將其熄滅。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>浸水的營火可以透過用打火石右鍵來移除浸水狀態。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>防止在點擊營火側面時，在相鄰方塊上放置火焰。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>如果玩家在營火內重生，他們將獲得 10 秒的火焰保護。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>如果重生時營火上方有方塊阻擋，會自動在營火上方創造一個兩格高的空間。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>蹲下 + 右鍵點擊床會覆蓋營火重生點的位置。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>蹲下 + 右鍵點擊營火會移除該重生點。或者在點燃營火時做出相同動作，可以防止設定重生點。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>campfiresStartUnlit</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，新放置的營火將處於熄滅狀態。<br><br><span><strong>sneakRightClickCampfireToUnset</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>蹲下/潛行並右鍵點擊營火可移除營火重生點。<br><br><span><strong>bedsOverrideCampfireSpawn</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，在床上睡覺會覆蓋營火重生點。<br><br><span><strong>createAirPocketIfBlocksAboveCampfire</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，若重生時營火上方意外被阻擋，模組會破壞其上方的方塊以創造空間。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>sendMessageOnNewCampfireSpawnSet</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，每當設定新的營火重生點時，會向玩家發送訊息。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnUnset</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，每當營火重生點被移除時，會向玩家發送訊息。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnMissing</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，每當重生時找不到營火重生點時，會向玩家發送訊息。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnOverride</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，每當營火重生點被 PlayerSetSpawnEvent 事件覆蓋時，會向玩家發送訊息。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>fireResitanceDurationOnRespawnInMs</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 10000，最小值 0，最大值 3600000<br>玩家在營火重生時獲得火焰抗性的持續時間（毫秒）。設定為 0 會停用此功能，並將玩家重生在營火旁邊。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>放置和破壞營火，以設定和移除重生點：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>在營火上放置泥土以將其熄滅：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"552\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>在營火處重生：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>在地獄中從地獄重生：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>在地獄中從主世界重生：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>使用打火石點燃營火以移除其浸水狀態：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以自由地在任何模組包中使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有任何問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
